              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár múk Moabu ngiwa axaás adór waawitaádá' tám nira hardáh ar haratleemu, muu sleémeero oo slaqwara ga aleesláw iimír na/aá ninakw ay bariise, kina ateét kiri xooslár slaqwarárí haniís tiri amohhe'eesiyé' slaqwaraaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matlaatleero múk Moabu tindiwa tláy qatuuwo, tsee/amá iwa gwa/aát gawaá daanduú ma'aydá', tawa qaytsiít ma'aay ki da/aten adór tseere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
