              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Moabu iwa hardáh dír xafoó múk Israeliro, kiri i haratláy niri gowiyé' geeraá múk Israeli wa aleeró, kiri sangw aluú wa guús ay Moabu, slám kaa loohi tsu/aa/ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsaduuín kina fe/iít. Umuú dír tara waaraahhi baraá qaymooro umuú heewo tlaa/ano guna tsaxaár, qaymo tlaa/eewo iri háts. Kutloó ma'aay nguri tipiyé' nee xaa'aá hhohho' kiri tlaáq. Aluuwo gár aa met a gixsár ur ar Kir-heresi kilós, kari harweér nee múk kuukumayár tlaquút, kari hayóh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
